# No image is built from the repository root; if one is, secrets never go
# into it, nor into the build stages and their cache (the same rules as in
# `source/tesk-core/.dockerignore`, checked by `tests/test_dockerignore.py`).
# The Git metadata: remote URLs may hold tokens
.git
# The storage credentials that the deployment docs have operators create
# from the templates
charts/tesk/s3-config/*
!charts/tesk/s3-config/*-TEMPLATE
# Secret files at any depth
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
**/.pypirc
**/.npmrc
**/.kube
**/*kubeconfig*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/secrets.yaml
**/tls-secret.yaml
